    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14339" root="رأى" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُؤْيَةٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأَى</span> [q. v.] : (T, S, M, Msb,
K:) [and also a subst.: used a as subst.,) it means
The <i>sight</i> of the eye; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأْىٌ</span></b> : [and accord.
to the M and K, it is with the mind also; like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأْىٌ</span>:] pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُوًى</span>. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِئْىٌ</span> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
[Also The <i>phasis</i> of the moon.]

